# Form Autofill

Chrome MV3 extension (`apps/autofill`, Vite port 9100). Scans forms, fills random or scenario values, and keystroke-types on localhost and `*.thedigitalgroup.com`. Full layout is in `apps/autofill/AGENTS.md`.

## Contexts

Popup, service worker, and content script share `src/shared/messaging.ts`. Only the service worker may call `chrome.storage` (`src/shared/storage.ts`). Content script exposes `globalThis.__FORM_AUTOFILL__.dispatch` and must not remount the FAB if that global already exists.

Do not re-inject content scripts before instant `FILL` or `AUTO_TYPE` — that flashes the tab. Probe/inject only for scan and pick (`shouldPrepareContentScripts`).

## Fill rules

- Scenario override, then persona, then `generateValue`. Default skips non-empty fields.
- Fill is framework-agnostic: native type / ARIA first; MUI and Ant Design class names are per-control last-resort selectors, never a page-level library switch.
- Dates fill before other fields. MUI DatePicker commits in the page MAIN world via `fillControlledDateMainWorld`, which Chrome serializes with `toString()` — no imports and no outer closures.
- `startFillSession` hides listbox/calendar portals and the save overlay only. Do not hide Dialog, Drawer, or Modal.

## Code

- New behavior under `src/features/<kebab-name>/` with an `index.ts` barrel. Import with `@/`.
- Do not import `@hrms/ui`. Components are `antd` only. Icons are `@ant-design/icons` only. Tailwind prefix `autofill:`.
- Host gate: `isAllowedPageUrl` / `ALLOWED_HOST_MATCH_PATTERNS`. Do not grant `<all_urls>`.
- Chrome `commands` come from `getChromeCommandsManifest()` (four suggested keys). Do not hand-edit them in `manifest.config.ts`.
- Colocate Vitest tests. Run `npm run test --workspace=autofill`.
